    "name": "Forehead Chip",
    "steam_appid": 2171910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.poster.avif?t=1754947091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.webm?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.mp4?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forehead Chip</strong> is a <strong>2D cyberpunk pixel-platformer</strong> set within a dystopian city split between those who implant chips in their hands. Join the Implant Corps and capture uncooperative deviants living within the forsaken cracks and crevices of society. Explore the divided city\u2019s secrets, whispers, and inner tensions and earn your worth as a recruit seeking to win the coveted <i>Forehead Chip</i>, the key that will give you ultimate status and access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing unique capturing and bullet collecting mechanics, play this nostalgic shooter that encourages skillful precision and chaotic action in a variety of stages, enemies, and obstacles. Engage in an ever-evolving narrative that affects your gameplay style and dynamics. Explore a steamy and detailed cyberpunk cityscape where discoveries and revelations uncover your place in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/45542d2728e83cac9aa0f1cfe240ad4a.webp?t=1754947091\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across the divided <i>Arca City</i>, where half the population have accepted digital implants to access basic services, as well as higher luxuries. While beyond the harbour in the disobedient <i>Holdout Districts</i>, vagrants needing \u2018liberation\u2019 roam the city\u2019s neglected wastes, urban dwellings, and industrial areas. Leave no stone unturned, as Holdouts use ingenious means to hide and arm themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.poster.avif?t=1754947091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.webm?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.mp4?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as young Chip, a recruit in the Implant Corps, and prove your worth to your friends and family by winning the coveted one-of-a-kind implant model: the <i>Forehead Chip</i>. Delve into a variety of unique locations, interact with characters across the political map, and let <i>your </i>actions dictate your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But once you dent the shiny surface of <i>Arca City</i>, everything is not as it seems, as unexpected paths to victory will open up for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/b8f70f6869068fed56b49a0f03378d12.webp?t=1754947091\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/b19ba31bcccc78ed42679b248b8f3477.poster.avif?t=1754947091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/b19ba31bcccc78ed42679b248b8f3477.webm?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/b19ba31bcccc78ed42679b248b8f3477.mp4?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop and venture into the besieged city districts through frantic action platforming with <strong>tight, tuned and responsive controls</strong>. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield a variety of <strong>uniquely controlled weapons and ammo upgrades</strong> to capture scores of Holdouts, bosses, and robots to mark your score on the Implant Corps leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>unique capturing and bullet-collecting gameplay</strong>, Forehead Chip offers new twists and thrilling moments for a classic genre.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/ecb47f4e6f8803b7fe515497c6c5701d.webp?t=1754947091\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/9c812e568ce11cfce82168a2ec5492b2.poster.avif?t=1754947091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/9c812e568ce11cfce82168a2ec5492b2.webm?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/9c812e568ce11cfce82168a2ec5492b2.mp4?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Corps in <strong>Singleplayer</strong> or in <strong>Two-Player CO-OP</strong> to compete and capture chipless Holdouts in the main story.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit your friends in a <strong>2-4 Player PVP Arena Multiplayer</strong> with over a dozen playable maps and competitive modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/d419b0a6d54a3211312c6374d497fdea.poster.avif?t=1754947091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/d419b0a6d54a3211312c6374d497fdea.webm?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/d419b0a6d54a3211312c6374d497fdea.mp4?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.poster.avif?t=1754947091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.webm?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.mp4?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forehead Chip</strong> is a <strong>2D cyberpunk pixel-platformer</strong> set within a dystopian city split between those who implant chips in their hands. Join the Implant Corps and capture uncooperative deviants living within the forsaken cracks and crevices of society. Explore the divided city\u2019s secrets, whispers, and inner tensions and earn your worth as a recruit seeking to win the coveted <i>Forehead Chip</i>, the key that will give you ultimate status and access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing unique capturing and bullet collecting mechanics, play this nostalgic shooter that encourages skillful precision and chaotic action in a variety of stages, enemies, and obstacles. Engage in an ever-evolving narrative that affects your gameplay style and dynamics. Explore a steamy and detailed cyberpunk cityscape where discoveries and revelations uncover your place in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/45542d2728e83cac9aa0f1cfe240ad4a.webp?t=1754947091\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across the divided <i>Arca City</i>, where half the population have accepted digital implants to access basic services, as well as higher luxuries. While beyond the harbour in the disobedient <i>Holdout Districts</i>, vagrants needing \u2018liberation\u2019 roam the city\u2019s neglected wastes, urban dwellings, and industrial areas. Leave no stone unturned, as Holdouts use ingenious means to hide and arm themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.poster.avif?t=1754947091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.webm?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.mp4?t=1754947091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as young Chip, a recruit in the Implant Corps, and prove your worth to your friends and family by winning the coveted one-of-a-kind implant model: the <i>Forehead Chip</i>. Delve into a variety of unique locations, interact with characters across the political map, and let <i>your </i>actions dictate your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But once you dent the shiny surface of <i>Arca City</i>, everything is not as it seems, as unexpected paths to victory will open up for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/b8f70f6869068fed56b49a0f03378d12.webp?t=1754947091\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla